{"product":{"id":6558304501934,"title":"Norix Max-Master 4 Seat Round Table","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eEngineered for superior strength and durability, Norix Max-Master tables are particularly well suited for dining halls and dayrooms where reliable performance is a must. Whether bolted to the floor or freestanding on adjustable glides, the distinctive individual seat\/leg design of the Max-Master tables provides superior stability than traditional pedestal tables. Compression molded composite seats, premium table top and unique steel leg design deliver an exceptional table for continuous daily use in challenging environments. The unique leg design is the key to the form and function of this high-performance fixed seating.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Size: 42\" round\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEdge Style: Laminated tops have Molded Edge, Stainless Steel top has Self Edge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEdge Color \/ Top Color choices:\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlack edge + \u003cspan\u003eTitanium Evolve top\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWild Cherry edge + Wild Cherry top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKensington Maple edge + Kensington Maple top\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAsian Sun edge + Asian Sun top\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMontana Walnut edge + Montana Walnut top\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGraham Cracker edge + Palisades Oak top\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHM Innertone Light edge + Calcutta Marble top\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eBlack edge + Black Alicante top\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBlack edge + Titanium Evolve Game Top\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStainless Steel edge + Stainless Steel top wrapped around Quietcore (S05)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLeg type: 3\u003cspan\u003e\" Leg \u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLeg colors: Black or Metallic Silver\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSeat colors: Twilight, Cove, Sand, Raven, Stainless Steel\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdditional charge applies for Stainless Steel top, Stainless Steel seats, or Game Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight 183 lbs laminate top, 174 lbs Stainless Steel Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpecify bolt-down or free-standing options:\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBolt down (hardware included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTamper-resistant leg glides (cannot be added later if bolt-down option is ordered)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClear PVC leg protectors, 3\" diameter x 6\" high, may be used with either bolt-down or glide option. Must be specified on order\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShips K.D. (knocked down) to save shipping cost\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eADA option: all Max-Master table configurations are available in an ADA version with legs configured to accommodate wheelchair access. Designed to be used \u003cbr\u003eonly with bolt-down option. No extra charge. Contact us for complete details\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandard hardware included: Torx tamper-resistant screws, precoated with Dri-Loc sealant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eAbout Norix Furniture:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNorix Group specializes in providing high quality, intensive-use institutional furniture designed specifically for behavioral health care facilities, hospitals, jails, prisons, detention centers, and other challenging markets. Norix humanizes behavioral and correctional facilities, while building extreme durability and security into each piece of institutional furniture so it stands up to correctional grade use. Norix furniture is as tough as your prison or detention grade environment, yet safe for trustees and staff. Anchortex supplies the complete line of Norix furniture for patient rooms, classrooms, inmate cells, day rooms, lobbies, intake areas, chapels, dining halls, outdoor\/recreation, contact visitation and video-visitation areas, as well as public safety furniture for police and fire stations that looks good and stands up to hard use. Norix meets or exceeds testing requirements for intensive-use institutional and detention grade furniture, and the everyday test of use at healthcare and detention institutions by people who don't necessarily have the best interests of the institutional furniture in mind.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Norix Furniture","product_type":"","created_at":"2021-03-11T21:49:51-05:00","handle":"norix-max-master-4-seat-round-table","updated_at":"2026-11-26T18:27:47-05:00","published_at":"2021-03-11T23:00:25-05:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"detention-furniture","variants":[{"id":39339459608750,"product_id":6558304501934,"title":"42\" Round, Molded Edge, Solid Top \/ Bolt Down Plate","price":"1637.60","sku":"ADS-N700126-02","position":1,"compare_at_price":"2047.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"42\" Round, Molded Edge, Solid Top","option2":"Bolt Down Plate","option3":null,"created_at":"2021-03-11T21:49:51-05:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T18:27:47-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"-","grams":115666,"image_id":null,"weight":255.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"USD","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":39339459641518,"product_id":6558304501934,"title":"42\" Round, Molded Edge, Solid Top \/ Clear Leg Protector","price":"1717.60","sku":"ADS-N700126-03","position":2,"compare_at_price":"2147.00","fulf